      "coverageNotes": [
        "The statewide November 3, 2026 SAMPLE Official Election Ballot supplies all listed candidates for U.S. Senate, all four U.S. House districts, and State House special elections in districts 70 and 77. Names and party labels follow the ballot. Incumbency and candidate websites are not stated.",
        "State Senate District 34 remains unverified for November 3: the Candidate Qualifying List has a State Senate 34 card with six names but supplies no election date, and that contest does not appear on the dated November sample ballot.",
        "The Secretary of State’s complete 12-page November 3, 2026 statewide SAMPLE Official Election Ballot contains candidate contests and no measure question through its END OF BALLOT marker. Statewide measure coverage is confirmed from the complete official ballot. The initiatives page lists proposals requiring certified signatures, not certified November measures.",
        "The qualifying-list page states that its entries reflect submitted papers and that the State Board of Election Commissioners determines qualifications before general-election ballot placement. Candidate completeness here is supported by the dated statewide official sample ballot."
